    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> interface for ThemisDB observability.</para>
<para>Provides integration with Prometheus <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> or compatible systems:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Send alerts for critical system events</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resolve alerts when issues are fixed</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Silence / acknowledge active alerts</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Production use: instantiate <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_default_alertmanager" kindref="compound">DefaultAlertmanager</ref> which implements the Prometheus <ref refid="classthemis_1_1observability_1_1_alertmanager" kindref="compound">Alertmanager</ref> v2 HTTP API with retry and auth-token support. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
